messages "Gorang**Subj: the time for resting has comeDate: Feb 14Alas the rabbits were too tough for me and I felt that I needed to let mine weary and broken body rest from any more ardous battles with furry creatures.I bid you farewell brave hobbit.Together soon we shall go and beat the living shit out of these cruel animals and show them way they should fear bastards like us with weaponsGorang**"
